# Visual identity lock (Soft Glass Enterprise OS) — D161

This lock applies to **every** future screen, module, gate, widget, and PR.
No parallel design system.

**Supersedes** Contiental Apple D095 · Utility Cube · Wick.

**Spatial composition** (placement, patterns, button grammar): documentation
`04_UI_UX/LAYOUT_CONSTITUTION.md` (**D225**). Soft Glass materials/chrome win on conflict.

## Before any UI work

1. Read `apps/web/src/app/globals.css` (`--a-*` tokens only).
2. Reuse `AppShell` + `MissionControl` / `ModuleFeatureList` + `SmartActionDock` + `A*`.
3. Match reference: `/` (Mission Control) · dock · `/settings` · `/dev/layout-gate`.
4. Identify page pattern (List / Detail / Form / Workflow / ModuleDashboard / Settings) + one primary action.
5. Compose with `APageBody` · `AFilterBar` · `AOverflowMenu` · `APageSection` · `ADetailGrid` · `AContextPanel` (D226).
6. If a screen diverges → **fix that screen**, never invent a second look.
7. **Registry-driven** — never hardcode sidebar, dashboard widgets, or actions.

## Locked identity (D161 — 2026-09-10)

| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Fonts | **Outfit** + JetBrains Mono (tabular) |
| Accent | Teal `#2dd4bf` (dark) / `#0d9488` (light) · sky secondary |
| Accent special | Violet **only** for priority / AI surfaces |
| Theme | Dark navy `#0a1628` default · light cool `#e8eef7` |
| Surface | `data-surface=patch\|ghost\|solid\|minimal` |
| Density | comfortable · compact · spacious |
| Materials | Glassmorphism blur · **zero frames** on panels · radius **tight** (2–6px) |
| Hierarchy | Soft underlays (`.a-underlay`) only |
| Actions | **Primary** (Nouveau/Enregistrer/Créer) = encadrement accent teal · **reste** = soulignement `--a-orange` (couleur icônes) + hover anim (D228) |
| Motion | Stagger rows · glow pulse · nav underline · quiet action underline |

## Chrome (mandatory)

- **Full-width topbar** above everything — logo + Powered by AUTHORITY left; search pill center; monitor rings · notifs · SPECTRE/PATCH/GHOST animated enter-icons · theme toggle · FR/IT · user photo
- Sidebar Finder + Smart Action Dock sit **under** the topbar (collapse does not move the bar)
- Features **never** in sidebar → Mission Control + embedded feature list
- Ops modes exit **only** via calculator unlock code (Admin-configurable)
- Right rail chrome: **Smart Action Dock only** (color shortcuts · system · resources · surface) — never replace with page-context rail
- Record/workflow context: optional **in-page** ContextPanel (underlay column or drawer), not the dock
- Pages: no `border-a-*` boxes · soft underlays only · width = remaining main column (no hard 1600px page lock; tables full remaining width)
- Status = pastel `ABadge` only
- Montants TND / stock = solid tabular
- AI panels: `DISABLED` / `UNAVAILABLE` — no crash if off
- Page header: one primary action right · secondary in `•••` when >2 · canonical FR labels (see LAYOUT_CONSTITUTION)

## Forbidden

- Framed cards / tables / panels (`border` chrome)
- Feature lists inside the sidebar
- Hardcoded sidebar / home actions / fake KPI widgets
- Contiental Apple soft empty Launchpad icons
- Purple-on-white cliché theme
- Second design system
- Inventing layout per module (must reuse Soft Glass + D225 patterns)
- Swapping Smart Action Dock for a module ContextRail

## New modules

Ship inside this shell. Ask before changing `--a-*` tokens.
